        {
            "id": "20260913A084TA00",
            "title": "药审提速、医保托底，政策组合拳护航国产创新药高质量发展",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O-3b3MpiqzZKoOTdlKW_gVwKgQIO9gfnFvI7Kg358HgUIAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260913A084TA00",
            "author": "马年限定",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-13 18:00:56",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><p data-pm-slice=\"3 3 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">来源：21世纪财经</span></span></strong></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">记者：韩利明 实习生 蒋雨桐</span></span></strong></p><section style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:rgb(136, 136, 136);line-height:14px;margin-bottom:22px;margin-top:8px;display:block\"></span></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\"><br/></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\">当前，中国创新药产业实现从跟跑到并跑、部分赛道迈入领跑的跨越。产业向上突破的背后，政策改革持续释放动能。近期，国家医保局“助力医药产业高质量发展媒体行”走进<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">信达生物</span></span></span>、<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">恒瑞医药</span></span></span>，一线对话企业研发、商业化负责人，近距离观察医保政策如何串联起患者用药可及、企业持续创新、产业走向全球的完整链条。</span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\">谈及产业发展根基，恒瑞医药企业发展中国负责人<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">刘宇婷</span></span></span>表示：“过去十年，中国医药产业实现跨越式发展，离不开两个强力的支柱——<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">药审改革</span></span></span>与<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">医保改革</span></span></span>，两项改革几乎同步推进、协同发力。”</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\">“药审改革打通产业前端，持续优化新药审评审批流程，加速创新药品上市进程；医保改革畅通商业化后端。自首轮<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">国家医保谈判</span></span></span>启动以来，政策规则逐年优化调整，逐步构建起常态化、动态化的目录调整机制，背后离不开国家医保局持续推进的大量工作。创新药企能够清晰预期，自研成果上市后可快速进入医疗机构实现落地销售，创新投入具备稳定回报预期，产业活力由此充分激发。这不仅惠及恒瑞医药，更为整个中国创新药行业注入持久动力。”该负责人进一步补充道。</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;line-height:1.6\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><strong><span>中国医保，一生守护！维护医保基金安全，人人有责！打击欺诈骗保举报电话：010-89061396，010-89061397；邮箱：jubao@nhsa.gov.cn。</span></strong></p></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
        },
